time: 4/4
level: 2
desc: The chorus of the cheerful Christmas song, key of G, first position. Bar 3 has a dotted rhythm (one and a half beats + half a beat).|欢快的圣诞歌副歌部分, G 调第一把位. 第三小节有附点节奏 (一拍半 + 半拍).
desc: Tip: it is fairly fast - practice at 60% first; open string 2 (B) is used the most, so be careful not to hit string 1.|小贴士: 速度较快, 可以先调到 60% 练熟; 2弦空弦 (B) 用得最多, 注意别扫到 1 弦.
